Package: liusheng
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: DHKun <DHKun@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.41), libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, libasound2t64 | libasound2, libpipewire-0.3-0, libqt6core6t64, libqt6gui6, libqt6qml6, libqt6widgets6, qml6-module-qtquick, qml6-module-qtquick-controls, qml6-module-qtquick-layouts, qml6-module-qtquick-window, qml6-module-qt-labs-platform, qml6-module-qtquick-shapes
Homepage: https://github.com/DHKun/Liusheng
Description: local lossless music player for Linux
 Liusheng is a Qt Quick music player focused on local FLAC collections,
 gapless playback, high-quality output and synchronized lyrics.
